# Whiskerquill Scribe's valiant "you may discard a card" (CR 701.9): Bot1 declines when Rabid Gnaw targets the Scribe, so nothing is discarded and nothing drawn - the "if you do" draw needs the discard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Whiskerquill Scribe
Rabid Gnaw
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

